Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.30,0:01:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.10,0:01:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.76,0:01:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was actually an ultimate Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the help of Paildramon,\Nwe managed to capture her,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.16,0:02:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Numemon put the wraps\Non us and they escaped.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx95\fscy95\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(208,367)}The Dark Ultimate
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx95\fscy95\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(418,403)}BlackWarGreymon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:12.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those Digibrats made me so tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to try to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.78,0:02:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should think happy thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.56,0:02:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, evil spells, crushing\Nmy enemies, more control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,less Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't keep those\Nkids out of my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How hard can it be to get rid of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did I go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually a bubble bath relaxes\Nme, but not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukenima, a rather unusual\Nplace for a tub, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess all you have to do is\Nbuild the rest of the house around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! Let's go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.96,0:02:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.48,0:03:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sure does look comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't had a bath like that in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think that I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you be quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.02,0:03:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you see I'm trying to concentrate?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.92,0:03:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those kids are destroying my\Nsupply of control, Spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to work faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.14,0:03:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, mind if I take a dip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Double star!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.78,0:04:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digmon, nice job! Shooting star!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.86,0:04:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.76,0:04:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say cheese, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.58,0:04:21.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.22,0:04:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're actually making progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.56,0:04:25.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's 147 so far today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.10,0:04:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we could all use a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thirsty! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I'm thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.00,0:04:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a vending machine with\Njuice in it back there a ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully it has milk,\Npreferably in a saucer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me too, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll just get something\Nand bring it back to you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:04:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind should we get you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.28,0:05:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, what's the matter with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:11.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.46,0:05:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know when something's wrong and\Nsomething's wrong. Now, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop asking me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.34,0:05:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Hmm. Hi, Oli.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you just gonna stay up\Nthere and be crabby all day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.08,0:05:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not crabby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it through your thick head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now there's the old Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.52,0:05:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come down\Nhere and we'll talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about Cody and Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you noticed they\Nnever talk to each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not friends and it's not\Nlike they argue the way you and I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They just don't talk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.30,0:05:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they're still both a little\Nnervous around each other well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.92,0:05:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't go on like this much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.18,0:05:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are we supposed to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.44,0:05:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.56,0:06:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken Cody, I need a hand, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that control spire over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that Fladramon wasn't\Nstrong enough to knock that one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.72,0:06:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do that blindfolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, it's a plan to get\NCody and Ken to work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.52,0:06:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.98,0:06:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go figure, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.56,0:06:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiking Strike Lady Rock Cracking
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.34,0:07:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay, we did it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morimont and Armadillamont seem\Nto be getting along just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now if only Cody and\NKen would act the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two just worked together\Nto destroy a control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you shake hands and be friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.66,0:07:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.57,0:07:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Fladramon could have\Ndestroyed that control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.82,0:07:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree with Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.88,0:07:39.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, please don't make us\Nwaste our energy like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, you're so stubborn! Please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.92,0:07:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems not every team member\Nwants us around, Wyrmon. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait! Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.30,0:07:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wyrmon, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:10.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need an\Nall-powerful Digimon if I ever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hope to squeeze the life\Nout of the Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I only used one Control Spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.70,0:08:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I created.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I tried using ten Control Spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.40,0:08:35.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:43.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I created this powerful creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet neither of them was sufficient\Nenough to defeat those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to destroy those kids, I'll\Nneed to use a hundred control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.72,0:09:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's going to use a hundred control\Nspires, how many hairs does she need?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, that's six, carry the four,\Nminus two, that would be a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have to use a hundred hairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could get a job in the\Ncircus as the bald lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.52,0:09:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you can join the circus\Non the flying trapeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.30,0:09:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time she treats me like that,\NI feel closer and closer to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could this be love I'm feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mummymon, would you hurry it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.16,0:09:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ninety-nine control spires\Non the side of the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.86,0:09:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ninety-nine control\Nspires, do not one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all those\Nbeautiful control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.92,0:09:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew those eager-veaver brats didn't\Nhave time to clean up this area yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.02,0:10:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love watching you work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you're really gonna love this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.66,0:10:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This creature will not only\Ndestroy the Digidestined,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.92,0:10:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but also the entire digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon of Darkness, come to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been up there ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.00,0:10:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gone ten minutes\Nand you cause a mutiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of them are so stubborn, neither one\Nof them is willing to talk to the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he feels terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.14,0:11:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.20,0:11:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should talk to both of\Nthem about acting their own age.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I can straighten them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, what exactly is so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, look, are you guys mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to give me the\Nsilent treatment, I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.94,0:11:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, take a look behind you. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you boys and girls be\Nhome with your mommies and daddies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you kids might enjoy playing\Nwith a little Digimon I put together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:09.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When will you learn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time you try to fight\Nus, you end up losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.40,0:12:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spirit Needle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.40,0:12:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a good time. Play nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.06,0:12:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.48,0:12:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.82,0:12:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.84,0:12:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.67,0:12:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And BMON!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:12:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.36,0:13:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The jump will be!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armored Digimon! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, flying home!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pokémon Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.12,0:13:35.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.32,0:13:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.16,0:13:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.26,0:13:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.76,0:13:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Master, Ankylomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.42,0:13:49.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Master, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi Armor, American!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.00,0:13:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Armor Digivolve, true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncover the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Bearimon, the Angel of Light!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.12,0:14:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.46,0:14:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They think they have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.62,0:14:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing quite relaxes\Nme like scaring kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.42,0:14:33.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.82,0:14:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DK and Kari are too far ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DK, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory! T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.64,0:15:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's Black War, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black WarGreymon is a Mega-Digimon who\Nlooks like WarGreymon, but he's pure evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His Terra Destroyer attack releases a\Nconcentration of 100 % negative energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black WarGreymon, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.60,0:15:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is, but I don't know how it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do, Ankylomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.28,0:15:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd say protecting the\Nkids is high on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.16,0:15:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree wholeheartedly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too strong for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.18,0:16:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need more help! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:18.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon is the only one\Nwho is strong enough to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to call Ken!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally, I'm good at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Email.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Yoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.90,0:16:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she want, Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to mess up\Nthe dynamics of your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worrying about our team is\Nthe least of our problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say forget about Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never needed him before,\Nand we don't need him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.76,0:16:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can do this on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.85,0:16:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of you knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.02,0:16:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're acting like a\Ncouple of 12-year-olds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.86,0:16:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.76,0:16:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aquilamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You called?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.04,0:16:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to find\NKen and bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the fort until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.20,0:16:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have created a magnificent specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.36,0:17:03.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you don't want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.80,0:17:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.10,0:17:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis and the others\Ncalled you, didn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.22,0:17:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.84,0:17:26.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arukenimon made this\Nreally strong Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need Paildramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.20,0:17:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.20,0:17:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.86,0:17:41.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Ken and Yuleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.24,0:17:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I slapped you,\Nbut you needed to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.82,0:18:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Stingmon will show up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.08,0:18:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.68,0:18:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,BlackwarGreymon, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finish them off once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.66,0:18:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Archnemon is your master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must do what she tells you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daisuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.04,0:18:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought Stygmon and\NKen to give us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.64,0:18:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.74,0:18:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,X-V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stingmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DNA Game Walk 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.44,0:18:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Airdramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.36,0:18:54.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black War Greymon, I've seen\Nthis mutant Digimon before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.24,0:19:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to show him who's the most\Npowerful Digimon in the entire digital world!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is gonna get ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, talk about meeting head-to-head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.18,0:19:13.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to need an aspirin the size\Nof a control spire after this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:16.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperado Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.06,0:19:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's not even a scratch on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.22,0:19:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Paildramon was our only\Nchance. Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.08,0:19:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have done an outstanding\Njob, BlackwarGreymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may now proceed to\Ndestroy the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there\Npatting yourself on the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your master has given you new orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.02,0:20:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.64,0:20:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take orders from no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.00,0:20:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I take orders\Nfrom you when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so weak you need me to\Ndo your fighting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.58,0:20:46.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must find a more worthy opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.02,0:20:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Orokenimon, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.76,0:20:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak to me, my darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.82,0:21:06.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can the Digidestined handle Black War\NGreymon and Arukenimon at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out on the next\NDigimon Digital Monsters!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.22,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.73,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to run with my hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.15,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to run with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so big?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't you feel the strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.94,0:21:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always, always, always.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.29,0:22:03.34,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be in the\Nway. It's always, always.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.34,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.66,0:22:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll always be able to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's always, always, always.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.34,0:22:17.23,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody is there.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.23,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.08,0:22:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.89,0:22:57.97,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fscx115\fscy115\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(318,332)}Storm of Love - Silphymon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.42,0:23:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.14,0:23:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time on Digimon\NAdventure: Silphie Mon.

